LABEL test.time=2024-01-02T03:04:05.5+01:00
LABEL test.time=2024-01-02T03:04:05.5
>>+ DL3053 3 -- RFC 3339 needs a digit after the decimal point
>>> DL3053 4
>>> DL3053 6
